OL,3,GNEWSAHunting, hooting and swooping owls
OL,4,Aas autumn nears
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal photographers have shared their
OL,7,Fimages of hooting, hunting and swooping
OL,8,Fowls, as autumn closes in.
OL,10,FMeteorological autumn began on Tuesday,
OL,11,Fwhile astronomical autumn starts with
OL,12,Fthe autumn equinox on 23 September.
OL,14,FDan Watson said spotting three
OL,15,Fshort-eared owls hunting on moorland
OL,16,Fnear Middleton-in-Teesdale was "one of
OL,17,Fhis most memorable encounters".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
