OL,3,GNEWSAHunting, hooting and swooping owls
OL,4,Aas autumn nears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Ashley Johnson, from
OL,7,FMiddlesbrough, described an "amazing,
OL,8,Fsurreal experience" sharing an evening
OL,9,Fwith a barn owl at Low Barns Nature
OL,10,FReserve, Bishop Auckland, last week.
